1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Clement_XIII '''Pope Clement XIII'''] (Latin: Clemens XIII), born Carlo della Torre di Rezzonico, was head of the Catholic Church and ruler of the Papal States from 6 July 1758 t
2 CONC o his death in 1769. He was installed on 16 July 1758.
