1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://wiki.karadimov.info/index.php/Ippolita_Ludovisi Wikipedia - English '''Ippolita Ludovisi''']
2 CONT * Olimpia Ippolita I Ludovisi (December 24, 1663 – December 29, 1733) was the Princess of Piombino from 1701 until her death. 
2 CONT * She was born in Cagliari, the daughter of Niccolò I Ludovisi.
2 CONT * On November 27, 1700 she inherited the family fiefs from her sister Olimpia, including Piombino. 
2 CONT * On 19 October 1681 she married Gregorio II Boncompagni, 5th duke of Sora and Arce.
2 CONT * The Principality of Piombino was then inherited by the members of the Boncompagni, through their daughter Maria Eleonora.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Lords of Piombino==== 
2 CONT * Preceded by Olimpia Ludovisi, Princess of Piombino 1701–1733 	
2 CONT * Succeeded by Maria Eleonora I Boncompagni (car)
