1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francesco_Maria_Pico_della_Mirandola
2 CONT
2 CONT >On 14 June 1716, he [Francesco Maria Pico della Mirandola] married Duchess María Teresa Spínola y de la Cerda, daughter of Duke Carlos Felipe Antonio Spinola (fourth Duke of Sextus and Marquis of Los Balbases as well as Grande de
2 CONC  España), who drowned on 15 September 1723 during a flood that swept through their house in Madrid;[3] Francesco Pio di Savoia (Francisco Pío de Saboya y Moura) also died in the tragedy.[4] In 1744 he married in second marriage ''
2 CONC 'Maria Guadalupe Fitz-James Stuart y Colón de Portugal''' (1725-1750), daughter of James Fitz-James Stuart, 2nd Duke of Berwick and Catalina Ventura Colón de Portugal, 8th Duchess of Veragua. He died in Madrid in 1747, without son
2 CONC s.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Fitz-James_Stuart,_2nd_Duke_of_Berwick
2 CONT
2 CONT >On 31 December 1716, the 2nd Duke of Berwick became the second husband of the dowager Catalina Ventura Colón de Portugal y Ayala-Toledo, 9th Duchess of Veragua (14 July 1690 – 3 October 1739). Catalina Ventura was the daughter of
2 CONC  Pedro Manuel Colon de Portugal y de la Cueva, (25 December 1651 - 9 September 1710). This made the 2nd Duke of Berwick also duke-consort of Veragua and of la Vega.They had 6 children, of whom 4 survived to adulthood:[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT # James Fitz-James Stuart, 3rd Duke of Berwick (28 December 1718 - 30 September 1785), who on 26 July 1738 married Maria Teresa De Silva y Haro.
2 CONT # Pedro de Alcántara, (1720–1791), Captain general of the Spanish Navy, married María Benita de Rozas y Drummond, no issue.
2 CONT # Ventura (1724 - ????), married María Josefa Gagigal y Monserrat, had 1 son.
2 CONT # '''Maria Guadalupe''' (1725–1750), married to Francesco Maria Pico, Duke of Mirandola, but no issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/memories/L2Z5-NVS
2 CONT # ''Los Descendientes de Cristobal Colon'', page 154.  https://www.familysearch.org/memories/memory/174353331?cid=mem_copy
2 CONT # https://www.thepeerage.com/p8736.htm
