1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marco, grandchild of Doge Antonio Grimani and brother of Vettor Grimani, was elected in 1522 as Procurator.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1529 he was appointed patriarch "elected" of Aquileia, but his authority remained very limited because his brother Marino Grimani reserved the title of patriarch, with right of regression, and the exercise of patriarchal functi
2 CONC ons, including the collation of ecclesiastical benefits.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was papal legate in Scotland between 1543 and 1544. https://www.jstor.org/stable/24409405?seq=1#page_scan_tab_contents
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1537 he was appointed Admiral of the pontifical portion of the fleet of the Holy League organized by Pope Paul III together with Venice, the Emperor Charles V and the Knights of Malta in anti-Ottoman function. With this qualifi
2 CONC cation he took part in the Battle of Prevesa.
2 CONT
