2 CONT               He is at inspection of the contrade on 06.06.1509 for contrada Giudecca
2 CONT               He is active for the liberation of his father-in-law Zaccaria Contarini together with Francesco Contarini di Zaccaria & Andrea Gussoni qu Nicolo
