1 NOTE {geni:about_me} After the death of her husband, in 1816, Elisabetta found herself in a legal battle with her husband's family regarding inheritance. Eventually, Elisabetta received the bulk of the inheritance including the propert
2 CONC y and castle in Celano. Being childless, when she died in 1825  her wealth went to her brothers, Claudio and Giuseppe. Eventually, the Celano properties ended up with Orazio, Giuseppe's son, who became the Count di Celano.
